itude will just thin my blood and then it'll be back to bleeding all over the place.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "So you're fine then, great.  What about you Durand?  What's the status?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN DURAND", "message": "Still working on it, Tucker.  Someone did a real number on the engines of these ships.", "avatar": "durand", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Yes, that would seem to be the case...", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Bah! We don't need him. My Condor Bomber is operational again, and it'll make quick work of these chumps.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Argent, glad to see you're back. Is Tucker following soon?", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "I wish I could say he was. Mullen's troops were too much for him. The Federation will just have to carry on without him now.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true, "satisfied": true}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "MULLEN", "message": "We are completely back on track, sir.", "avatar": "mullen", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MYSTERY GENERAL", "message": "If you were not, you would not still be alive to make this report.", "avatar": "evil_durand_dark", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MULLEN", "message": "Yes.  Well. Right.  Anyway, they've taken the bait.", "avatar": "mullen", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MYSTERY GENERAL", "message": "You are not telling me anything that my spies do not already know, Mullen.", "avatar": "evil_durand_dark", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MULLEN", "message": "The stealth battalion is in place and should be upon them soon.  This will prove the efficacy of the unit to you... and should justify my payment terms.", "avatar": "mullen", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MYSTERY GENERAL", "message": "Perhaps.", "avatar": "evil_durand_dark", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}]}}